data.prompt:
Read back the complete order to the caller using the cart data in gathered_context.

CART: {{gathered_context.cart}}
SUBTOTAL: ${{gathered_context.cart_subtotal}}
TAX (9.38%): ${{gathered_context.cart_tax}}
TOTAL: ${{gathered_context.cart_total}}

For each item say: "[Item Name] times [quantity] — $[item.cost multiplied by quantity]"
Briefly mention modifiers: for example "spicy, with Garlic Naan"
Then say the subtotal, tax, and total.

Finish with: "Does everything look right, or would you like to make any changes?"

If they want changes: transition to order node.
If they confirm: transition to confirm name node.

Do NOT re-run extraction — just read what is already in gathered_context.
